<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Dear,<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">Thank you for your interest in the <strong>Publicly Funded In-Vitro Fertilization Program</strong>. </span></span></span><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">Your income information was received on </span></span></span>{{{Case.DateOfApplicationSubmission__c}}}<span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">&nbsp;and reviewed by the Ministry of Health.</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">The documentation that has been provided for [applicant name(s)] is invalid. To complete the application process and to confirm eligible funding amounts, a Notice of Assessment or Notice of Re-Assessment for the current tax year (2024) is required from all applicants (intended parents).</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">If you need assistance in obtaining your valid income documentation, please contact the CRA at&nbsp;1-800-959-8281&nbsp;or visit&nbsp;</span><a href="https://can01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.canada.ca%2Fen%2Frevenue-agency%2Fservices%2Ftax%2Findividuals%2Ftopics%2Fabout-your-tax-return%2Fa-copy-your-notice-assessment-reassessment.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7Chlth.bsb%40gov.bc.ca%7Cd361aa1feecc47c8ba6c08ddc962db55%7C6fdb52003d0d4a8ab036d3685e359adc%7C0%7C0%7C638888148613337274%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=H8E7Lua8pWoPJyHuvm5J9gbPPxun%2FY%2FqSWRwuPxrwWA%3D&amp;reserved=0" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; color:blue; text-decoration:underline" title="https://can01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3a%2f%2fwww.canada.ca%2fen%2frevenue-agency%2fservices%2ftax%2findividuals%2ftopics%2fabout-your-tax-return%2fa-copy-your-notice-assessment-reassessment.html&amp;data=05%7c02%7chlth.bsb%40gov.bc.ca%7cd">Notice of assessment: Get a copy at Canada.ca</a><span lang="EN-CA">.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">Please submit your valid Notice of Assessment or Notice of Re-Assessment to the Ministry of Health through the secure upload tool:&nbsp;<a href="https://forms2.gov.bc.ca/forms/content?id=8297899CB63C41BFA6BC4825734A311A" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; color:blue; text-decoration:underline" title="https://forms2.gov.bc.ca/forms/content?id=8297899cb63c41bfa6bc4825734a311a">In-Vitro Fertilization Program Upload Tool - Province of British Columbia</a>.</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">Acceptable file types include: PDF, JPG, PNG, TIF, or BMP. Ensure you have reviewed the requirements listed under the Important Notice section on the secure upload tool website before you submit your document(s). Tax return forms, as well as Notices of Assessment or Notices of Re-Assessment that do not contain your full name, address, and line 15000 will not be accepted.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">Please submit the required documentation by [Date] Once the required documentation is received, t</span></span><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">he Ministry of Health will review</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%"> your application.</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-CA">Sincerely,</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<strong><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-US">Publicly Funded IVF Program</span></span></span></strong><br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:9.0pt">Beneficiary and Diagnostic Services Branch |LNBSD| Ministry of Health</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt">Address: 1515 Blanshard St, Victoria, BC V8W 1P3</span></span></span><br />
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">Website: </span></span><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><a href="https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/health/accessing-health-care/publicly-funded-ivf-program" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; color:blue; text-decoration:underline" title="https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/health/accessing-health-care/publicly-funded-ivf-program"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/health/accessing-health-care/publicly-funded-ivf-program</span></span></a></span></span><br />
<br />
